Built on:

- Base UI (MIT) — https://base-ui.com
  Copyright Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates

- shadcn/ui (MIT) — https://ui.shadcn.com
  Copyright shadcn
  Southpaw uses the shadcn registry format and credits shadcn
  as a foundational influence on the project.

- libphonenumber-js (MIT) — https://github.com/catamphetamine/libphonenumber-js
  Copyright catamphetamine
  A lighter rewrite of Google's libphonenumber. Used by
  Southpaw's phone input for as-you-type formatting and
  country code detection across all international formats.

- react-phone-number-input (MIT) — https://github.com/catamphetamine/react-phone-number-input
  Copyright catamphetamine
  Battle-tested phone number formatting for React. Used by
  Southpaw's Input component (purpose="phone") for reliable
  international number formatting across 250+ countries.

- imask (MIT) — https://imask.js.org
  Copyright Alexey Kryazhev
  Input masking library. Used by Southpaw's Input component
  for credit card number, expiry, and CVV formatting.

- country-codes-list (MIT) — https://github.com/nicosommi/country-codes-list
  Complete list of 250 countries with ISO codes, calling
  codes, and flag emojis. Used by Southpaw's phone input
  country selector.

